Sval: Remove installer attribution

AttributionCode read the campaign Mozilla's download pages stamp on an
installer, and MacAttribution its macOS counterpart, for Firefox's
telemetry, onboarding and messaging. Sval's installers carry no such
stamp and Sval sends no telemetry. The component goes, with the
targeting attributes and Nimbus targeting context metric built on it,
the telemetry environment's attribution section, Normandy's
`attribution` filter value and the tests that spoofed it. The
component's metrics file also defined glean.distribution, which the
telemetry environment records, so that metric moves to Telemetry's own
metrics file.

